Batten is a port to Common Lisp of NLib, the NURBS curve and surface
library inside NVIDIA's open-source SMLib (USD BRep):

  https://github.com/NVIDIA-Omniverse/usd-brep
  Copyright (c) 2020-2026 NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Each source file says which NLib file it was ported from.  The port is a
modified version of that work and is distributed under the same license.
"NLib", "SMLib" and "USD BRep" are names used by NVIDIA; Batten is not
affiliated with or endorsed by NVIDIA.
